<title>USA: Malden, Mass., won by State Street Bank.</title>
<headline>Malden, Mass., won by State Street Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Bank and Trust Company of Boston said it won $4.400 million of Malden, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1996 bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.55 percent.</p>
</text>
